@title Commissioning: a failed field results import is a job flag with Retry and Dismiss
@area Commissioning
# T13: a file that is not a field results file fails to import. The failure is a job flag on the top bar pill (one pill for every job); the popover has Retry, Copy details and Dismiss; Dismiss clears it. The menu items sit at fixed places in the panel (277 370 is "Import field results").
open_starter_example
wait 20
click_text Commissioning #1
wait 20
answer_dialog qa/fixtures/files/not-a-drawing.dxf
click_text "Your name"
wait 6
click 277 370
wait 20
shot failed-import
expect "Not a field results file"
click_text "Error: Not a field results file" Button
wait 8
expect "Retry"
expect "Copy details"
expect "Dismiss"
shot popover
check_layout
click_text "Dismiss" Button
wait 8
expect_not "Not a field results file"
shot dismissed
check_layout
